---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout_project.astro';
---

<Layout title="No-UserName | CyberSG">
    <section class="section project">
        Character Design • Digital Ilustration
        <div class="proyectos">
            <h1 class="display_text">No-UserName</h1>
            <svg class="ani-icon" width="280" height="300" viewBox="0 0 480 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M471.99 334.43L336.06 256l135.93-78.43c7.66-4.42 10.28-14.2 5.86-21.86l-32.02-55.43c-4.42-7.65-14.21-10.28-21.87-5.86l-135.93 78.43V16c0-8.84-7.17-16-16.01-16h-64.04c-8.84 0-16.01 7.16-16.01 16v156.86L56.04 94.43c-7.66-4.42-17.45-1.79-21.87 5.86L2.15 155.71c-4.42 7.65-1.8 17.44 5.86 21.86L143.94 256L8.01 334.43c-7.66 4.42-10.28 14.21-5.86 21.86l32.02 55.43c4.42 7.65 14.21 10.27 21.87 5.86l135.93-78.43V496c0 8.84 7.17 16 16.01 16h64.04c8.84 0 16.01-7.16 16.01-16V339.14l135.93 78.43c7.66 4.42 17.45 1.8 21.87-5.86l32.02-55.43c4.42-7.65 1.8-17.43-5.86-21.85"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="content-description">
            <div class="clients-wrapper">
                <div class="clients">
                    <img src="../images/myself.avif" alt="Logo CyberSG"></img>
                    CyberSG
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="block horizontal line">
            <div class="experience-container proyectos">
                <div class="content-subtitle">
                    <span>Role</span>
                </div>
                <div>Illustrator</div>
            </div>

            <div class="experience-container proyectos">
                <div class="content-subtitle">
                    <span>Timeline</span>
                </div>
                <div>2021</div>
            </div>

            <div class="experience-container proyectos">
                <div class="content-subtitle">
                    <span>Stack</span>
                </div>
                <div>Clip Studio Paint, Ilustrator, Photoshop</div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <img class="image-large" loading="eager" src="../images/nousername_post.avif" alt="Ilustración de la portada de comic No-UserName cayendo y agarrando una pieza de rompecabezas brillando."></img>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="container project">
            <div class="block project">
                <div class="content-subtitle red">01 [//] Story</div>
                <div class="block full_width">
                    <h2>'They say that a NAME defines a person.'</h2>
                    <p>Born unable to see the world, but having tasted its worst side. <strong><i>["No-Username"]</i></strong> reaches the age of choosing whether to continue living or to rest in peace, but a <strong><i>gift from her missing father</i></strong> will make her doubt. Finding her father to discover her true name is her mission.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section full-width" style="background-image: url('../images/Collage_nousername.avif');">
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <img class="image-large" loading="lazy" src="../images/nousername_sheet_3.avif" alt="Character Sheet del personaje No-UserName el cual contiene las diferentes vistas y emociones que suele msotrar el personaje como enojo, desesperación o tristeza."></img>
    </section>
</Layout>